<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">Jonah</book>
  <para style="h">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jonah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jonah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Amittai’ tapa Jonah kungah Topa’ thu tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A lien mama Nineveh khuopi ah tu mama-in va pei ta’nlen, tua khuopi langkhatah va tangko in; azieh pen ka mai-ah a gitlona uh ang tungto ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa opna panin Tarshish lamah a taimang dingin Jonah a dingkhie hi. Joppa lamah ama peisuh a, Tarshish a zuon ding tembaw khat mu hi; tuaci’n ama in tembaw sap pie-in a tungah kato a, Topa kung panin a taimang dingin amate tawh Tarshish khuo ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle Topa in tuipi tungah huipi hat mama khat langsah a, tua a gimnei huipi in tuipi a nawh ziehin tembaw a sie dingin a kisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin tembaw nasemte zau-in a pasien kung ciet vuah a kiko uhi. Amate in tembaw a zan tuom nadingin tembaw sunga a om vante tuipi sungah a pai uhi. Khum hun laitahin tembaw sung inndan neita penah Jonah kumsuh a, tuale na lumin na kimu hit hiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tembaw uhpa pei-in ama kungah, “Bangci banga hici kimut ziuzieu thei na hei? Tho inlen, na pasien kungah thu ngen ven! Tua pasien in eite si loin i suotah thei nadingin ei ngaisutpieh maw lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tembaw nasemte in, “Hing pei un, koi zieha tami tuosietna hing tung ahei, ci i thei nadingin ai san vai,” ci-in khatlekhat kiho uhi. Tuaci’n amate in ai a san ule Jonah tung a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in a kungah, “Bang zieha tam bang tuosietna eite tunga hing tung ahei, ei gen in. Nang bang sem na hei? Hei pana hing pei na hei? Na gam bang ahei? Nang koi minam na hei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Kei Hebrew mi ka hi a, tuipi le leigaw a bawl vantung’ Pasien ahi Topa ka bie hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua mite a zau zawkan lai vua, ama kungah, “Ta na bawl khu bang ahei!?” a ci uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa opna pana a tai ahi lam a gensa ahi ziehin amate in a thei zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in ama kungah, “Eite ading tuipi a dai thei nadingin bang kang law ding vuoi?” a ci uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile tuipi ah huipi hat semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Ei domto unlen tuipi sungah ei pai un; tua ciengin note adingin tuipi ang dai pai ding hi; azieh pen note tungah tami huipi gimnei ang lanna pen keima zieh ahi, ci ka thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua mite in lei lamah tembaw a kinuale thei nadingin nahpitahin a hot paupau uhi, hizongle amate langkhatah tuihuol hat semsem ahi ziehin a hotzo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate Topa kungah kiko-in, “ Topa aw, kang thum uhi, tam mipa sina ziehin kote ei mangthaisah sin, ci-in kang thum uhi. Maw nei lo mi khat’ sisan luonna ziehin mawna ei puosah sin; azieh pen Topa aw, na lungkimna banga na bawl ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Jonah domto-in tuipi sungah a khiesuh uhi; tuale tuipi kilawh vapualpi a dai pai lien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin mite in Topa a giing zawkan lai vua, Topa tungah biehnate pie-in kiciemna a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jonah valtum dingin Topa in nga golpi khat a pie hi; tuale ngapi gil sungah Jonah ni thum le zan thum sung a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jonah in ngapi gil sung panin Topa a Pasien kungah thu ngen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama in “Ka cimawna panin Topa ka hlan a, ama in kei ei dawng hi; Misikhuo’ gilpi sung panin ka kiko a, ama in ka aw ei za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuipi thuh a laikim tahah kei nei sepdawh a, tuikhang in kei ei kimkot hi; na tuihuol zosiete le na tui kilawhte in ka tungah ei viel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, ‘Na opna panin ei kinotmang hi; na biehinn siengtho kang bangci nua-etkia thei ding ahei?’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka tungah tui in ei tuomcip hi; tuili thuh in ei imtawm hi; ka lu kimvelah tuipi lopate in kei ei vielcip ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Muolsang bulte ah ka kumsuh a, kumtawnin kot ei khalu thei kotgolh a nei gam sungah ka va kumsuh ta hi; hizongle Topa ka Pasien aw, tua Leihawmpi sung panin nang in ka hinna nei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lung a kieh ciengin Topa ka phawh hi; tuale na biehinn siengtho sung nangma kungah ka thungetna ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kimanna a nei lo milim biete in amau’ dihtatna a nuasie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima lungdam kona tawh nangma kungah biehpiehnate ka pie ding hi; ka kiciemnasa ka tangtun ding hi. Tatkhietna Topa -a’ ahi hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in ngapi hopi a, tuale ama in leigaw tungah Jonah a luokhie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jonah kungah a niveina Topa’ thu tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tho inlen khuopi lien Nineveh ah pei-in, tua khuopi ah na kunga kang gensa thu va tangko in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa’ kammal dung zui-in Jonah kuonin Nineveh khuopi ah a pei hi. Nineveh khuo pen khuopi lien mama khat hi a, keng tawh ni thum sung kikantan khop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuopi sunga lut dingin Jonah kipan a, ni khat sung lam a pei hi. Tuale ama in, “Ni sawmli zaw ciengin Nineveh khuopi kisusie ding hi,” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale Nineveh khuomite in Pasien a um uhi; amate in antan ding thu tangko-in, mi zosie, a neu a lienin la-ip puon a sil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nineveh khuo kumpipa in tua thu a zah ciengin a kumpi topha panin dingin a puontuol sutdawh a, ama le ama in la-ip puon silin vut lahah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Nineveh khuopi sungah tangtawhna khat a bawl hi: “Kumpipa le a miliente thukhenna dung zui-in: Mihing ahi a, ganhing ahi zongin, bawnghon ahi a, tuuhon ahi zongin, koima in bangma kici khat zong ciem thei lo ding hi. Amate in an ne loin tui zong a dawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihingte le ganhingte in la-ip puon silin Pasien kungah nahpi-in a kiko ding uhi. A gitlo gamtatnate ule a khut utawh a bawl uh tatsietnate panin mi zosie a kihei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eite i manthai lo nadingin Pasien in a lungsim khelin a lungsona panin a kihei sih ding hi, ci koi in thei ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amau’ sepnate le a gitlo gamtatnate uh panin a kiheina uh Pasien in a mu bepin, amate tungah a tung dinga a gensa sietna tunsah lo dingin a lungsim a khelkia hi; tuale ama in tua sietna a tungsah nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam thu in Jonah lungkimsah lo a, ama a lungthah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Topa kungah thungen a, “Aw Topa! Ka gama ka oplai-a ka thugen tami hi lo amah? A kipat cil panin Tarshish khuopi-a ka taisimna zong tami zieh ma ahi hi. Bangzieh ahei cile nang pen mi hepi thei le mi khuotuo siem, a lungduoi, le itna kip tawh a kidim, dan pieh lo nading lungsim khelin a baisa-a a om Pasien na hi, ci kang thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in, “ Topa aw, keima kung panin ka hinna ei la ta’n, azieh pen ka hin sangin si leng kei adingin a phazaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuale Topa in, “Na lungthah khu man na sah ma amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin khuopi pulamah Jonah pusuohin ama adingin tua munah buhno khat a lam hi. Tua khuopi bang ang ci mawngmawng ei mah, ci-in a en dingin tua buh hlim nei-ah ama to-in a ngah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa Pasien in sawlbawh khat bawl a, a lutunga a hlim ding, a lungkhamna a damsah dingin tua sawlbawh in Jonah lutung a khusah hi; tuaci’n khumi sawlbawh ziehin Jonah a lungdam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin zingmawng khuo a vah ciengin Pasien in tua sawlbawh a vulgawp nadingin lungno khat in a susiesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni a suo ciengin Pasien in nisuona lam huisa langsah a, ni in Jonah’ luzang a kapsuh ziehin basamin si ding a ngen hi. Ama in, “Ka hin sangin si leng kei adingin pha tazaw va,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in Jonah kungah, “Sawlbawh tungtang na lungthah khu man na sa amah?” a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “Man sa na’ng, si nading khopin ka lungthah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in, “Na gimpi vawt lo le na khansah thei vawt lo, zankhat thu-a ang po, zan khat thu ma-a a mangthaikia tua sawlbawh khat pamai nasa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale keima in a sunga a zietlam le a veilam zong a khen thei lo mi tulza le tul sawmni val a opna le ganhing tampite a opna Nineveh khuopi lien khu pamaisa loin ka om ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
